    "created_at": "2018-01-03T04:53:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-03T04:53:32Z",
    "body": "FYI the W3C CSS checker (validator) now categorizes the `zoom` property as a “vendor extension” — which means that if a user has selected the option to treat “vendor extension” as warnings, a warning message (rather than an error) is emitted when `zoom` is encountered in a stylesheet.",
